Arabic News Headline Generation using RNN & LSTM

📌 Project Overview

This project aims to build an Arabic Natural Language Processing (NLP) system that automatically generates short, meaningful headlines from Arabic news articles.

The system uses Sequence-to-Sequence (Seq2Seq) architectures based on Encoder–Decoder models to learn the relationship between news articles and their corresponding headlines.

Two deep learning models are implemented and compared using the same prepared dataset:

* SimpleRNN Encoder–Decoder
* LSTM Encoder–Decoder

The goal is to evaluate their performance and determine which model generates better Arabic headlines.

⸻

